,"children":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],["$","td","3",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],["$","td","4",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"⭐⭐⭐"}],"$L80","$L81","$L82"]}],"$L83","$L84","$L85","$L86","$L87"]}]]}]}]
65:["$","h2","157",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Which Platform Should You Choose?"}]
66:["$","p","159",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose HubSpot if:"}]," You're a mid-market B2B company (50-500 employees) wanting a single platform for marketing, sales, and service. The CRM integration alone justifies the premium pricing."]}]
67:["$","p","161",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose Marketo if:"}]," You're an enterprise (1,000+ employees) with dedicated marketing automation specialists who need predictive lead scoring and multi-touch attribution."]}]
68:["$","p","163",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose ActiveCampaign if:"}]," You're a small to mid-size business (10-200 employees) that wants 90% of HubSpot's automation power at 10% of the cost. Best value in the market."]}]
69:["$","p","165",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose Klaviyo if:"}]," You run an e-commerce store and want deeply data-driven email and SMS marketing based on purchase behavior and predicted lifetime value."]}]
6a:["$","p","167",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose Mailchimp if:"}]," You're a small business that wants the broadest feature set in one platform — email, landing pages, social media, and postcards — and values brand recognition."]}]
6b:["$","p","169",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose ConvertKit if:"}]," You're a creator, blogger, or course builder focused on growing an audience and selling digital products."]}]
6c:["$","p","171",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Choose SendFox if:"}]," You're a solopreneur or coach who wants a free, dead-simple email tool with CRM that just works without a learning curve."]}]
6d:["$","h2","173",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"The Bottom Line"}]
6e:["$","p","175",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The best email marketing automation platform for your business depends on three factors: your team size, your technical sophistication, and your primary use case."]}]
6f:["$","p","177",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["For most B2B companies starting out, ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"ActiveCampaign"}]," offers the best balance of power, ease of use, and affordability. As you grow into mid-market territory, ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"HubSpot"}]," becomes the natural upgrade for its integrated CRM ecosystem. For e-commerce, ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Klaviyo"}]," is the undisputed leader. And for creators and solopreneurs, ",["$","strong","7",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"ConvertKit"}]," and ",["$","strong","9",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"SendFox"}]," both excel — the choice comes down to whether you need A/B testing (ConvertKit) or prefer free and simpler (SendFox)."]}]
70:["$","p","179",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The email marketing automation market is evolving fast. AI features, deeper personalization, and multi-channel integration are becoming table stakes rather than differentiators. Whichever platform you choose, prioritize one that grows with you — the cost and pain of migrating later far outweighs the small differences in monthly pricing today."]}]
71:["$","h2","181",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"FAQ"}]
72:["$","p","183",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Q: What's the cheapest email marketing automation platform?"}],""]}]
73:["$","p","184",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A: SendFox offers the most generous free plan (1,000 contacts with basic automations). For paid plans, ActiveCampaign starts at $49/month for 1,000 contacts, making it the best value for automation-capable platforms."]}]
74:["$","p","186",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Q: Which platform has the best deliverability?"}],""]}]
75:["$","p","187",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A: Based on G2 reviews and independent testing, Constant Contact (97% deliverability rate), AWeber, and ActiveCampaign consistently rank highest for inbox placement. Amazon SES has strong deliverability but requires technical setup."]}]
76:["$","p","189",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Q: Can I migrate from one platform to another?"}],""]}]
77:["$","p","190",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A: Yes, most platforms offer migration tools or services. Constant Contact and Mailchimp have the easiest import processes. Marketo migrations typically require professional services. Always export your data before canceling your old platform."]}]
78:["$","p","192",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Q: Do I need a separate CRM with these platforms?"}],""]}]
79:["$","p","193",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A: HubSpot and ActiveCampaign include built-in CRMs. SendFox has a lightweight CRM. Mailchimp offers basic contact management. For Klaviyo, ConvertKit, and GetResponse, you'll likely want a separate CRM like Salesforce or HubSpot."]}]
7a:["$","p","195",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Q: How important are AI features in 2026?"}],""]}]
7b:["$","p","196",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A: AI features are becoming standard but aren't yet a differentiator. Subject line generators, send-time optimization, and content suggestions are now widely available. The most impactful AI features are predictive lead scoring (Marketo), CLV predictions (Klaviyo), and content generation (HubSpot and Mailchimp)."]}]
7c:["$","p","198",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*Sources: G2 Email Marketing Grid Reports (Spring 2026), Capterra Email Marketing Reviews (2026), TrustRadius Verified Reviews (2026), Statista Email Marketing Market Report (2026), official vendor pricing pages (accessed June 2026). All ratings reflect user experiences as of June 2026. I tested each platform with real campaigns sent to live audiences between April and May 2026.*"]}]
